[I] Client utility for CESNET TCS API

[T] cesnet-tcs-cli provides the cesnet-tcs utility for requesting and
[T] fetching server certificates from CESNET TCS via its API, plus cron
[T] scripts for fully automated certificate renewal before expiration. It is
[T] written in POSIX shell.

[U] https://github.com/jirutka/cesnet-tcs-cli

